{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_1","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"大涅槃經師子吼品","sortOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_2","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"涅槃以四句讀.如來性品是法句.三行德王諸品是法行句.迦葉品是法用句.而師","sortOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_3","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"子吼品是法義句也。師子吼者.大無畏.決定說.說一切衆生皆有佛性也。何爲佛性.","sortOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_4","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"一切諸佛以此爲性.阿耨多羅三藐三菩提爲佛.其種子爲佛性.其體爲觀十二因","sortOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_5","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"緣智。十二因緣.亦因亦因因亦果亦果果.是因非果如正因了因佛性.是果非因如","sortOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_6","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"涅槃.是因是果如緣所生法.不生不滅不常不斷不一不異不來不去.非因非果.雲","sortOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_7","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"何不是佛性.故曰煩惱卽菩提.十二因緣卽佛性。何爲衆生皆有.衆生者上至除佛","sortOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_8","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"下至一闡提.而皆有者.非已有而當有.又決定有也。一因不成事.有正因.有緣因.正","sortOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_9","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"緣時合有了因.正因爲衆生.緣因爲六度萬行.了因爲佛性.但正無緣不了.了非先","sortOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_10","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"時有也.但緣無正不了.緣且不了緣.焉能了物.了是合時有也.是故非因中有果而","sortOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_11","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"當有也。菩提無常.而佛性是常.覆而不見故說爲無.然能修道決定見性.皆有正因","sortOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_13","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"皆能修道.是故非因中無果而決定有也。唯識談所生得.生則一切生.一法不可生.","sortOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_14","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"故有漏無漏種子.有雜染清淨現行.而後得異熟.而後得四智相應心品.涅槃談所","sortOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_15","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"顯得.顯則一切顯.一因不可顯.故有衆生正因.修道緣因.而後得佛性了因也。就佛","sortOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_16","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"徧照邊言曰菩提是用.就佛寂靜邊言曰涅槃是體.而皆以見性而得.是故經言修","sortOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_17","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"集戒定慧道爲見佛性故.見性爲得菩提故.得菩提爲得涅槃故.又經言.受持禁戒","sortOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_18","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"爲心不悔故.乃至解脫爲得涅槃故.得涅槃爲得常樂我淨乃至爲見佛性故.見性","sortOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_19","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"爲轉依.轉依爲見性.是故見性重也。衆生性覆.闇昧不見.初地無漏種現而見道.見","sortOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_20","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"道以還極至九地.性少分見.是爲聞見.十地以首楞嚴三昧見.如來則了了見.是爲","sortOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_21","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"眼見.是故須修道也。涅槃爲無相三昧.無相三昧以十相得.以修定慧捨得.以成信","sortOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_22","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"戒等得.是故須修道也。雲何修道.讀大涅槃經受持禁戒其始.漸次得第一義空頂","sortOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_23","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"三昧等其竟也。讀師子吼品能尋其義.於大涅槃經思過半矣.是又始中之始也歟。","sortOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_25","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"一辨佛性義","sortOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_27","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"次廣說佛性義初正說佛性義","sortOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_28","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│四　二│","sortOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_31","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"四　三　二　非　非　初　次　初","sortOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_32","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"共　三　解　因　因　因　答問三","sortOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_33","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"有　學　縛　中　中　果問兩見問","sortOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_34","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"各　│　無　有　二四種　性","sortOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_35","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"有　│　果　果　三　三","sortOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_37","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"三　二　一│　以　以　以　以　以　以　不　四三　性　次　性　初","sortOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_38","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"力　積　業│　緣　不　過　了　種　正　了　答答　四　答　中　答","sortOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_39","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"勝　習　有│　不　見　未　因　種　緣　│三菩見　何　道　何","sortOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_40","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"陰　巧　無│　相　非　有　明　喻　二　│　薩性　義　名","sortOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_41","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│　有　有　明　明　因　│　見二　佛　佛","sortOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_42","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│　明　明　明　│　│　│","sortOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_45","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"二一三次　初　二　初　四　三　二　一","sortOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_46","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"解難眼　廣　見　聞　十　受　破　我　首　一　觀","sortOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_47","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│　┌──────┴──┐　見　辨　見法經　惑　稜　乘　緣","sortOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_48","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│　僧　菩　不　發　闡　業　│五聞　非　見見　見嚴　智","sortOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_49","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│　常　提　退　心　提　│　見　眼　性　性","sortOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_50","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"│依　人　人　人　│","sortOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_53","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"菩　五　四　三　二　一　五　四　三　二　初","sortOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_54","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"提　退　義　性　遲　心　見　辨　以　見　辨以　見辨　以　見　以　眼　以","sortOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_55","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"非　不　非　非　非　非聞　色聞見聞　佛　眼戒　見　釋","sortOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_56","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"性　退　世　佛　退　性　見　非　見不見　二　見　辨　聞","sortOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_57","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"是　眼　色眼　見眼　身　眼　聞　見","sortOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_59","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"三辨餘義　二辨涅槃義","sortOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_60","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"四││五","sortOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_62","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"四　三　二　一　乃　五　乃　四　得　非　定　二一","sortOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_63","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"佛　八　不　難　得　讀　得　修　涅　報　名　無時","sortOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_64","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"不　不　可　行　涅　經　涅　道　槃　定　涅　住地","sortOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_65","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"化　思　思　苦　槃　見　槃　見　不　槃　無莊","sortOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_66","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"生　議　議　行　性　│　性　│　相嚴","sortOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_68","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"三　二　一　之　次　之　初　唯　三　時　次　入　一","sortOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_69","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"性　空　修　修　涅　無　涅　無　佛　莊　入　二　涅　拘","sortOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_70","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"須　等　見　得　槃　相　槃　住　嚴　涅　月　槃　尸","sortOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_71","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"修　爲　性　│三生　生　雙　槃　十　│二那","sortOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_72","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"得　佛　│　死　死　樹　五　│　地","sortOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_74","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"三　二　一次　初","sortOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_75","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"得　成　得　修　無　無而　窮　聖　拘","sortOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_76","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"無　信　無　定　相　十降　逐　事　尸","sortOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_77","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"相　戒　相　慧　涅　相於　六　蹟　那","sortOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_tang_yeu_242_78","chapterId":"ch_work_tang_yeu_242","text":"等　捨　槃　名此　師　爲","sortOrder":78}],"overrides":{}}